### Submit Intake (with Email Notifications)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/intake/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ventureName_en": "Mekong Agro",
  "ventureName_km": "មេគង្គ អាគ្រូ",
  "country": "Cambodia",
  "description_en": "Agri platform",
  "wss": {
    "seeing": "no_difficulty",
    "hearing": "some_difficulty",
    "walking": "no_difficulty",
    "cognition": "no_difficulty",
    "selfCare": "no_difficulty",
    "communication": "no_difficulty"
  },
  "registration": { "number": "REG123", "country": "KH", "legalType": "LLC", "yearEstablished": 2020 },
  "impactAreas": ["agri", "climate"],
  "founders": [{ "fullName": "Alice Founder", "email": "alice@example.com", "phone": "+855123456" }],
  "financials": { "currency": "USD", "lastFYRevenue": 100000, "avgMonthlyRevenue": 8000 },
  "gedsi": { "hasPolicy": true, "notes": "Basic policy" },
  "triageTrack": "unassigned",
  "triageRationale": "Initial"
}

### Venture Summary
GET http://localhost:3000/api/ventures/REPLACE_ID/summary

### Assign Track
POST http://localhost:3000/api/ventures/REPLACE_ID/.assign-track
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: JWT REPLACE_TOKEN

{ "track": "fast", "rationale": "High potential" }

### Send Signature
POST http://localhost:3000/api/agreements/REPLACE_AGREEMENT_ID/.send-signature
Authorization: JWT REPLACE_TOKEN

### Get Lookups
GET http://localhost:3000/api/lookups

### Signed URL and Upload
POST http://localhost:3000/api/uploads/signed-url
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fileName": "doc.pdf", "contentType": "application/pdf", "size": 1024 }

### Upload file (replace URL)
# curl -T ./doc.pdf "REPLACE_URL_FROM_PREVIOUS_RESPONSE"

### Test Email Configuration
GET http://localhost:3000/api/email/test-config

### Send Test Email
POST http://localhost:3000/api/email/test
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "testEmail": "your-email@example.com"
}

### Check Intake Status (with Email Logs)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/intake/submit?id=REPLACE_INTAKE_ID

### =========================================================================
### Document Endpoints (API Contract v1 §6)
### =========================================================================

### 1. List Documents (§6.1)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/documents
Cookie: payload-token=REPLACE_TOKEN

### 2. Upload Document (§6.2 - multipart/form-data)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/documents
Cookie: payload-token=REPLACE_TOKEN
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="documentType"

Pitch Deck
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="notes"

Q3 Investor Pitch Deck
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="pitch_deck.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./doc.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 3. Upload Document with Invalid Type (Should return 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/documents
Cookie: payload-token=REPLACE_TOKEN
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="documentType"

invalid_type_test
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./doc.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 4. Get Document Metadata (§6.4)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/documents/REPLACE_DOC_ID
Cookie: payload-token=REPLACE_TOKEN

### 5. Download Document (§6.4)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/documents/REPLACE_DOC_ID?download=true
Cookie: payload-token=REPLACE_TOKEN

### 6. Review Document (§6.5 - Staff only: admin or miv_analyst)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/documents/REPLACE_DOC_ID
Cookie: payload-token=REPLACE_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "approved",
  "notes": "Reviewed and verified against requirements."
}

### 7. Delete Document (§6.3)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/documents?id=REPLACE_DOC_ID
Cookie: payload-token=REPLACE_TOKEN
